      "edition": "Œuvres complètes de Bossuet, éd. F. Lachat, Paris, Vivès, 1862-1866, in the typed transcription of the Bibliothèque monastique (Abbaye Saint-Benoît de Port-Valais), Wayback Machine",
      "description": "Typed transcription of volume I, pages 005 and 007-009.",
      "tier": "A",
      "tierEvidence": "Bossuet died in 1704; Lachat 1862-66 is public domain."
    }
  ],
